      "text": "Visual Aesthetic Quality Evaluation. We use HPSv2 as aesthetic assessment metric and evaluate on\nDrawBench. As shown in Table 7, BiDPO achieves a 2.65% improvement in visual quality. This indicates that\nBiDPO enhances visual quality while improving compositionality.\n",
